{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01VquG96rDtueWhn5akNvGAU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Typesafe & Fast as fuck Set in C\n2\t![](https://i.imgur.com/4JE58Ew.png)\n3\t\n4\t### Key Features\n5\t* Extremely fast non-cryptographic hash algorithm [XXHash](https://cyan4973.github.io/xxHash/)\n6\t* Complete Typesafe APIs\n7\t* **Double Hashing** to avoid both Primary & Secondary clustering\n8\t* **Robinhood Hash**(*in progress*) for near constant time access\n9\t* Iterators for streaming usecase\n10\t* Allows **Custom Hash** & **Custom Comparator**\n11\t* Single header file to rule them all 🚀 🚀 🚀\n12\t\n13\tGo to this [blogpost](https://robus.dev/typesafe-and-fast-as-fk-set-in-c) for more information and motivation for writing Set from scratch.\n14\t\n15\t### Getting Started\n16\t```c\n17\t#include <stdio.h>\n18\t#include \"cset.h\"\n19\t\n20\t// Declare Cset of int type\n21\tCset(int) cset_int_t;\n22\t// Declare Cset iterator of `cset_int_t` type\n23\tCset_iterator(cset_int_t) cset_iterator_int_t;\n24\t\n25\tint main() {\n26\t    // Instance of cset_int_t\n27\t    cset_int_t cset_int;\n28\t\n29\t    // Initialize\n30\t    cset__init(&cset_int);\n31\t\n32\t    // Add elements\n33\t    cset__add(&cset_int, 1);\n34\t    cset__add(&cset_int, 2);\n35\t    cset__add(&cset_int, 2); // Duplicate\n36\t\n37\t    size_t size = cset__size(&cset_int);\n38\t    printf(\"Size of set is: %ld\\n\", size);\n39\t\n40\t    // Iteration\n41\t    cset_iterator_int_t cset_iterator_int;\n42\t\n43\t    // Initialize iterator with cset_int\n44\t    cset_iterator__init(&cset_iterator_int, &cset_int);\n45\t\n46\t    // Traverse\n47\t    for(;;) {\n48\t      if (cset_iterator__done(&cset_iterator_int)) break;\n49\t\n50\t      int* buffer;\n51\t      cset_iterator__next(&cset_iterator_int, buffer);\n52\t\n53\t      printf(\"Got: %d\\n\", *buffer);\n54\t    }\n55\t}\n56\t```\n57\t\n58\t###\n59\t### Installation\n60\tSimply copy paste `cset.h` in your source directly or you can use [Clib](https://github.com/clibs/clib) package manager for installation\n61\t```sh\n62\tclib install robusgauli/cset\n63\t```\n64\t\n65\t### APIs\n66\t* `cset__add(cset, value)`: *no return*\n67\tAdd element to set.\n68\t    ```c\n69\t    #include \"cset.h\"\n70\t\n71\t    Cset(char) cset_char_t;\n72\t\n73\t    int main() {\n74\t      cset_char_t cset_char;\n75\t      cset__init(&cset_char);\n76\t\n77\t      // Add elements to set\n78\t      cset__add(&cset_char, 'a');\n79\t      cset__add(&cset_char, 'b');\n80\t    }\n81\t\n82\t    cset__free(&cset_int);\n83\t    ```\n84\t\n85\t* `cset__remove(cset, value)`: *no return*\n86\tRemoves element from the set.\n87\t\n88\t    ```c\n89\t    #include <assert.h>\n90\t    #include \"cset.h\"\n91\t\n92\t    Cset(int) cset_int_t;\n93\t\n94\t    int main() {\n95\t      cset_int_t cset_int;\n96\t      cset__init(&cset_int);\n97\t\n98\t      cset__add(&cset_int, 34);\n99\t      assert(cset__size(&cset_int) == 1);\n100\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bee7f5c9-fa72-456f-8684-c5515216635e","uuid":"90d476d6-6e89-4c95-819d-eb1154b26c35","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:02:56.827Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-31062124/harvest-crust-GRKYbz/project/c_src/README.md","content":"# Typesafe & Fast as fuck Set in C\n![](https://i.imgur.com/4JE58Ew.png)\n\n### Key Features\n* Extremely fast non-cryptographic hash algorithm [XXHash](https://cyan4973.github.io/xxHash/)\n* Complete Typesafe APIs\n* **Double Hashing** to avoid both Primary & Secondary clustering\n* **Robinhood Hash**(*in progress*) for near constant time access\n* Iterators for streaming usecase\n* Allows **Custom Hash** & **Custom Comparator**\n* Single header file to rule them all 🚀 🚀 🚀\n\nGo to this [blogpost](https://robus.dev/typesafe-and-fast-as-fk-set-in-c) for more information and motivation for writing Set from scratch.\n\n### Getting Started\n```c\n#include <stdio.h>\n#include \"cset.h\"\n\n// Declare Cset of int type\nCset(int) cset_int_t;\n// Declare Cset iterator of `cset_int_t` type\nCset_iterator(cset_int_t) cset_iterator_int_t;\n\nint main() {\n    // Instance of cset_int_t\n    cset_int_t cset_int;\n\n    // Initialize\n    cset__init(&cset_int);\n\n    // Add elements\n    cset__add(&cset_int, 1);\n    cset__add(&cset_int, 2);\n    cset__add(&cset_int, 2); // Duplicate\n\n    size_t size = cset__size(&cset_int);\n    printf(\"Size of set is: %ld\\n\", size);\n\n    // Iteration\n    cset_iterator_int_t cset_iterator_int;\n\n    // Initialize iterator with cset_int\n    cset_iterator__init(&cset_iterator_int, &cset_int);\n\n    // Traverse\n    for(;;) {\n      if (cset_iterator__done(&cset_iterator_int)) break;\n\n      int* buffer;\n      cset_iterator__next(&cset_iterator_int, buffer);\n\n      printf(\"Got: %d\\n\", *buffer);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n###\n### Installation\nSimply copy paste `cset.h` in your source directly or you can use [Clib](https://github.com/clibs/clib) package manager for installation\n```sh\nclib install robusgauli/cset\n```\n\n### APIs\n* `cset__add(cset, value)`: *no return*\nAdd element to set.\n    ```c\n    #include \"cset.h\"\n\n    Cset(char) cset_char_t;\n\n    int main() {\n      cset_char_t cset_char;\n      cset__init(&cset_char);\n\n      // Add elements to set\n      cset__add(&cset_char, 'a');\n      cset__add(&cset_char, 'b');\n    }\n\n    cset__free(&cset_int);\n    ```\n\n* `cset__remove(cset, value)`: *no return*\nRemoves element from the set.\n\n    ```c\n    #include <assert.h>\n    #include \"cset.h\"\n\n    Cset(int) cset_int_t;\n\n    int main() {\n      cset_int_t cset_int;\n      cset__init(&cset_int);\n\n      cset__add(&cset_int, 34);\n      assert(cset__size(&cset_int) == 1);\n","numLines":100,"startLine":1,"totalLines":434}}}
